  "description": "Connects the OASIS to IPFS -- the content-addressed, peer-to-peer hypermedia protocol for permanent, decentralised data storage. Stores OASIS holons, avatar metadata, and binary assets on IPFS with CID-based addressing ensuring data integrity. Optionally pins to Filecoin for long-term persistence. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
