  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.IPFSOASIS v2.0.7\n\nConnects the OASIS to IPFS -- the content-addressed, peer-to-peer hypermedia protocol for permanent, decentralised data storage. Stores OASIS holons, avatar metadata, and binary assets on IPFS with CID-based addressing ensuring data integrity. Optionally pins to Filecoin for long-term persistence. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.6\n- Fix IPFS avatar save acknowledgements and preserve original native fixture intent (e614982)\n- Fix IPFS deletion acknowledgement and reconcile owned graph fixtures (2250746)\n- Fix shipping IPFS encoding ABI with pinned source SDK and explicit app composition (33e2f87)\n- fix!: expose published IPFS core contract instead of private HTTP concrete field (b1c1e11)\n- fix(ipfs): capture search scope and reuse retained native fixtures (5614a3f)\n- fix(ipfs): report acknowledged returned-root read counts (0c2642a)\n- fix(ipfs): retain planned child roles; checkpoint native acceptance gate (b0daf55)\n- fix(ipfs): validate index identity selectors against canonical records (5d13d83)\n- Implement capability-aware IPFS current-CID CQL reads (838a141)\n- Integrate IPFS activation verified against native Kubo (977f897)\n- Integrate verified IPFS catalogue publication and restart coverage (e317e89)\n- Integrate verified IPFS publication across provider instances (4221d2d)\n- Integrate verified IPFS publication across writer processes (42c07ce)\n- Native import: Azure Cosmos, SOLID, ActivityPub, IPFS and Solana readers; STAR CLI nativeimport and cql commands; docs (fc85a95)\n- Native import: bring your own connection (provider, API and test changes) (8717f37)\n- Native import: the other five readers take a caller connection; stateless readers for connections; guarded HTTP handler; pin Core and STAR ODK (29dcbf9)\n- Prepare retained native IPFS demo source and explicit read-only query activation (131fd48)\n- Reconcile original IPFS saves and fix graph publication counts (8e45fc7)\n- Remove obsolete commented IPFS search implementation (6e1d272)\n- Sandbox and native import: every setting comes from DNA (OASIS.Sandbox, OASIS.NativeImport); no hard-coded limits or environment variables; pin Core and STAR ODK (203c4f9)\n- Verify IPFS native storage baseline and fix deleted child membership (45430a1)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Network/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.IPFSOASIS",
